WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:00.920 line:90%
 I gotta hug this man.

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:02.325 line:90%
I love this game so much.

00:00:02.325 --> 00:00:04.225 line:90%
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.300 line:90%
 Hey Marvelites!

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.750 line:90%
Ryan Penagos, a.k.a.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.590 line:10%
Agent M, here outside the
Square Enix press conference

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:17.460 line:10%
at E3 2019, where we
just revealed "Marvel's

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:19.430 line:10%
Avengers" to the world.

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:20.430 line:90%
Very exciting.

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:23.423 line:84%
So exciting, in fact, that I
had to grab a couple of fans

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:24.290 line:90%
and see what they thought.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.170 line:90%
Let's check it out.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.160 line:90%
I'm here with Bruno.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.147 line:84%
Amy.
Megan.

00:00:27.147 --> 00:00:28.380 line:84%
All right, I'm here
with my man Dave.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.870 line:90%
Dave, "Marvel's Avengers."

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:30.670 line:90%
We saw the trailer.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:31.470 line:90%
We saw the reveal.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:33.060 line:90%
How are you feeling?

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.430 line:84%
 I can't put it
into words, man.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:36.540 line:84%
"Avengers" popped
on that screen.

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:37.440 line:90%
You saw San Francisco.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:40.320 line:90%
You saw the Quinjet fly in.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:44.250 line:84%
I just-- I had a religious
experience, Ryan.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.330 line:90%
 Captain America dies?

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:46.700 line:90%
What?

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:49.220 line:84%
And who was the person
narrating the entire thing?

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:51.240 line:84%
 You know what, after
watching the teaser

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:56.010 line:84%
for about three years 100
times, this was so satisfying!

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:57.570 line:90%
 Man, I was stoked.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.660 line:84%
I mean, did you guys really
kill Captain America?

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:04.739 line:84%
I'm really eager to see what's
happening with Steve Rogers.

00:01:04.739 --> 00:01:06.750 line:84%
 We were already calling the
characters, like "I got Cap!

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:07.713 line:90%
I got Cap," you know?

00:01:07.713 --> 00:01:09.180 line:84%
Everyone's just really
excited for the game,

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:10.080 line:90%
and it caught me off guard.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:11.347 line:84%
Like, the gameplay
looked really cool.

00:01:11.347 --> 00:01:13.460 line:84%
Like, everyone looks like they
play completely differently.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.700 line:84%
 When they
mentioned that it was

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.260 line:84%
gonna be a four-player
online co-op,

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:17.227 line:90%
we were like, "Yo, it's time.

00:01:17.227 --> 00:01:18.027 line:90%
It's time."

00:01:18.027 --> 00:01:18.870 line:90%
 Count us in.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.370 line:90%
And you got great voice actors.

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:22.320 line:84%
When we saw the voice
actors there, I was like,

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.850 line:84%
we've seen them
all over the place.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:24.650 line:90%
We're in.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:25.890 line:90%
 I'm gonna say it.

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:26.760 line:90%
Game of the year.

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:28.680 line:90%
Right now, I'm calling it.

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:31.590 line:84%
Marvel, Square,
Crystal, thank you.

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:32.490 line:90%
You're the champion.

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:34.110 line:90%
No one else is gonna top you.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.320 line:90%
This is what I want.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:38.190 line:84%
If I could have it
tomorrow, I would love you,

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:39.990 line:90%
but May can't come fast enough.

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:41.940 line:84%
 As you can see,
people are hyped.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:45.270 line:84%
And so am I. It's a
big E3 2019 for Marvel.

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:46.860 line:90%
Stay tuned for so much more.

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:49.320 line:84%
I'm Ryan, and this is
Marvel, your universe.

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:51.770 line:10%
[MUSIC PLAYING]

